			<h1>ReceiptReady</h1>
<p>ReceiptReady is a desktop app for small business owners and freelancers who want a simple way to keep track of their receipts.</p>
<p>You can add, edit, and delete receipts with a vendor, date, amount, and category, mark purchases as tax-related, and see a spending summary with totals for each category.</p>

<img src="/images/receipt-list.png" width="100%" alt="ReceiptReady receipt list window">

